{"parentUuid":"c6020518-a6cf-49fa-86c7-42fcc2e3d84a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJ9qn6ZfAEWGjcqKivip","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The slow test isn't needed in its current form.\n\n- **What it guards:** `crates/core/tests/compile_fail.rs` checks that code outside the crate can't build a `ParsedProp` with a struct literal, so it must go through `ParsedProp::new`. That keeps `required` and `defaultValue` consistent.\n- **Why it's slow:** it uses trybuild, which compiles a separate test crate in `target/tests/trybuild` against the whole dependency tree (OXC and the rest). Once that's built it's cheap: Test / Rust takes about 1.5 minutes in CI. Locally it took minutes because switching branches changed `Cargo.lock`, so trybuild rebuilt every dependency, possibly while waiting on cargo's build lock.\n- **michi does the same thing:** `crates/michi-core/tests/ui_fail.rs` runs about a dozen trybuild cases (non-exhaustive types, `#[must_use]`, missing serde) inside its normal `cargo nextest` runs.\n- **callisto has no compile-fail tests** at all.\n- **A cheaper way to keep the guarantee:** a rustdoc `compile_fail,E0451` example on `ParsedProp` (\"field is private\"). `cargo test --doc` compiles it against the crate that's already built: no second dependency build, and trybuild drops out of the dev-dependencies. It loses only the exact-error-text comparison against the `.stderr` file; the error code still pins it to the private-field error.\n\nI'd switch Caliper to the doc example as a small separate PR. michi could do the same, but its many cases share one trybuild build, so its cost is spread out. Want me to make that change in Caliper?\n\nThe release re-run is still running; I'll report when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":704450,"output_tokens":1208,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":627},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1208,"cache_read_input_tokens":704450,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"28771f55-a950-420b-b80b-5011aad2ef5a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJ9qmgGZ9AogeZ85wBEk","requestRef":"ef290472-f2d8-4858-839a-d8292cd87578","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"51ffba03-bc8c-4b1f-9410-ee673a510043","timestamp":"2026-10-22T23:36:08.815Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
