{"parentUuid":"f0ac1036-d736-437c-baa0-ca5f0bc3727f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJEcAwhHakz6qw4mPbFd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The token fix worked, and the release is now being finished in a background loop. I'll report when it completes.\n\n**Published so far (0.3.0):**\n- crates.io: `caliper-docgen-core`, `caliper-docgen`\n- npm: `caliper-docgen-darwin-arm64`, `caliper-docgen-darwin-x64`\n\n**Why it keeps stopping:** each re-run publishes one npm package, then Callisto checks for the new version about 35 seconds later. npm hasn't listed it by then, so Callisto stops rather than carry on. Callisto calls this registry propagation lag and says to re-run once npm catches up. Re-runs skip everything already published.\n\n**What's running:** a loop that re-runs the failed job, waits until npm lists the package just published, and re-runs again, at most 10 times. Still to publish are the remaining platform packages, `caliper-docgen-napi`, `caliper-docgen` and `caliper-docgen-vite-plugin`.\n\n**A Callisto issue to fix:** its post-publish check is too short for npm and fails one package at a time. It should retry the check for several minutes, or carry on and reconcile at the end. I can open that against the Callisto repo if you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2371,"cache_read_input_tokens":729107,"output_tokens":400,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2371,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":400,"cache_read_input_tokens":729107,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2371},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bb4c7d0a-66e6-41a4-ba1a-4abac7d538c4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJEcAXt9LYJMAEkK9NCU","requestRef":"88420253-f268-4a1d-9b15-33b66f28bbc6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"db60d874-5047-4e99-832c-eab2b9bc606d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:38:29.246Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
