{"parentUuid":"590cde04-41a4-44b5-8bd0-784e6bfc7554","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22869d72-e274-4f00-90d5-202724c91b5a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B7coQ1rcL4AFQwFAB2BbJ5","type":"tool_result","content":"c3d524d3aba359f5e767007ea76d229e8a291dc3\n# Pinned to callisto 0.11.0 in .github/workflows/release.yml.\n\n# `match` is a package name (\"<ecosystem>/<name>\"), never a directory path.\n# Root package.json is `caliper-docgen-workspace` so bare `caliper-docgen` stays unambiguous.\n\n[changesets]\ndir = \".changeset\"\n\n[cascade]\nmode = \"out-of-range\"\nbump-severity = \"patch\"\npeer-escalation = true\npreserve-npm-ranges = true\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen-core\"\npublish-to = [\"crates-io\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen\"\npublish-to = [\"crates-io\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n# FFI shim: versioned with its npm wrapper, never published to crates.io.\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen-napi\"\npublish-to = []\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen-napi\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n# The npm wrapper is meaningless without a matching binding build.\n[[fixed-group]]\nname = \"napi-and-binding\"\nmembers = [\"cargo/caliper-docgen-napi\", \"npm/caliper-docgen-napi\"]\n\n# The npm wrapper redistributes this crate's binaries.\n[[fixed-group]]\nname = \"cli-and-npm-wrapper\"\nmembers = [\"cargo/caliper-docgen\", \"npm/caliper-docgen\"]\nrelease-decision.json  1.1K\n`ComponentMapping` now records which extractor rule matched it (`DetectionRule`), and `ComponentMapping::new` takes it as a required argument. The on-disk parse cache is rebuilt once (schema 7).\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: patch","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a047187e-356e-4a78-a532-c4e723831a2f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:47:13.424Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"c3d524d3aba359f5e767007ea76d229e8a291dc3\n# Pinned to callisto 0.11.0 in .github/workflows/release.yml.\n\n# `match` is a package name (\"<ecosystem>/<name>\"), never a directory path.\n# Root package.json is `caliper-docgen-workspace` so bare `caliper-docgen` stays unambiguous.\n\n[changesets]\ndir = \".changeset\"\n\n[cascade]\nmode = \"out-of-range\"\nbump-severity = \"patch\"\npeer-escalation = true\npreserve-npm-ranges = true\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen-core\"\npublish-to = [\"crates-io\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen\"\npublish-to = [\"crates-io\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n# FFI shim: versioned with its npm wrapper, never published to crates.io.\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"cargo/caliper-docgen-napi\"\npublish-to = []\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen-napi\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n[[package]]\nmatch = \"npm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin\"\npublish-to = [\"npm\"]\nrelease-trigger = \"changeset\"\n\n# The npm wrapper is meaningless without a matching binding build.\n[[fixed-group]]\nname = \"napi-and-binding\"\nmembers = [\"cargo/caliper-docgen-napi\", \"npm/caliper-docgen-napi\"]\n\n# The npm wrapper redistributes this crate's binaries.\n[[fixed-group]]\nname = \"cli-and-npm-wrapper\"\nmembers = [\"cargo/caliper-docgen\", \"npm/caliper-docgen\"]\nrelease-decision.json  1.1