{"parentUuid":"7dcefa0d-60ad-4edd-845e-62e2abc3fbaa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22869d72-e274-4f00-90d5-202724c91b5a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011cZbGr54PKVqqEuDfXvPqc","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_callisto.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"018fd47f-4376-4f1c-99de-549c25cd5d69","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:48:27.821Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_callisto.md","content":"Callisto 0.11 stops the release after each npm publish: it checks for the new version about 30 seconds later, npm hasn't listed it yet, and the job exits with E157. Releasing 0.3.0 took one re-run per npm package. 0.12.0 waits up to 6 minutes for npm (2 for Cargo), and the wait also applies to a re-run that finds the version already published.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `release.yml` and `ci.yml`: Callisto's actions pinned to `callisto@0.12.0` (`c3d524d3`, the commit the annotated tag points to); `setup-callisto` installs `callisto@0.12.0`.\n- `callisto.toml`: the pin comment.\n\n## Checked\n\n- The three actions' inputs are identical in 0.11.0 and 0.12.0 (`setup-callisto`, `callisto-action`, `callisto-validate`).\n- `callisto.toml` already uses the `ecosystem/name` form 0.12 requires (E316/E317), and its fixed groups pair separate packages, not one package under two names (E250).\n- `callisto status --check` with the 0.12.0 binary passes on this branch.\n\nThe in-flight 0.3.0 release keeps running on 0.11; re-runs use the workflow the run started with.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e65b1176-5712-4605-b6e9-2d35b100109c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"ci/callisto-0.12","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7dcefa0d-60ad-4edd-845e-62e2abc3fbaa","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"ci/callisto-0.12","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
