pe":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"ci/callisto-0.12","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"9befcdcb-0a1a-4725-95d2-ec2e25c7285c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22869d72-e274-4f00-90d5-202724c91b5a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MnMB7Z6JC9qy9McRJETyeh","type":"tool_result","content":"## 0.13.0\n\n- The release pull request no longer says \"All changes are backward compatible\" when a package is below 1.0.0 and gets a minor bump. It says that minor bumps below 1.0.0 can include breaking changes and to read the changes first.\n- A registry in callisto.toml can set `publish-timeout` (for example `publish-timeout = \"5m\"`) to change how long one publish command may run before Callisto stops it with E025. The default stays 15 minutes.\n- When a run adopts a Cargo or npm version that is already published, Callisto now warns if the registry records a different repository for it than this repository's origin, since the name may belong to someone else's package. It still adopts the version. A registry that records no repository, and PyPI, are not checked.\n- Release binaries are now published for Intel macOS (`x86_64-apple-darwin`) and arm64 Linux (`aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu`) as well as the existing three, and the `setup-callisto` action downloads them on those machines instead of building from crates.io. An older release without the new asset still installs from crates.io.\n\n## 0.12.0","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c159676d-7066-4cb2-a972-9856d1eadc63","timestamp":"2026-10-23T00:51:00.412Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 0.13.0\n\n- The release pull request no longer says \"All changes are backward compatible\" when a package is below 1.0.0 and gets a minor bump. It says that minor bumps below 1.0.0 can include breaking changes and to read the changes first.\n- A registry in callisto.toml can set `publish-timeout` (for example `publish-timeout = \"5m\"`) to change how long one publish command may run before Callisto stops it with E025. The default stays 15 minutes.\n- When a run adopts a Cargo or npm version that is already published, Callisto now warns if the registry records a different repository for it than this repository's origin, since the name may belong to someone else's package. It still adopts the version. A registry that records no repository, and PyPI, are not checked.\n- Release binaries are now published for Intel macOS (`x86_64-apple-darwin`) and arm64 Linux (`aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu`) as well as the existing three, and the `setup-callisto` action downloads them on those machines instead of building from crates.io. An older release without the new asset still installs from crates.io.\n\n## 0.12.0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"d7de9109-e421-453c-a760-f2fe5b94855f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"ci/callisto-0.12","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9befcdcb-0a1a-4725-95d2-ec2e25c7285c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"ci/callisto-0.12","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
