{"parentUuid":"118e8589-b0ab-43dd-8485-b1534dfb4b84","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJHCMrhtfEwTgWRCVLZt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Release 0.3.0 is done and the \"Release & Publish\" run passed.\n\n- **crates.io:** `caliper-docgen-core` and `caliper-docgen` at 0.3.0.\n- **npm:** all 13 packages at 0.3.0: `caliper-docgen`, `caliper-docgen-napi` and `caliper-docgen-vite-plugin`, plus the 5 platform packages each for the CLI and the binding.\n- **Tags:** Callisto tagged each package at 0.3.0 (for example `caliper-docgen-core@0.3.0` and `npm/caliper-docgen@0.3.0`). No GitHub Releases pages exist, for 0.3.0 or 0.2.1.\n\nIt took 15 attempts on run 39808667033, because Callisto 0.11 stopped after every npm publish. #98 (pin Callisto 0.12.0) is green and fixes that for the next release; merge it before then.\n\nIn flight:\n- #94, the speedups, stacked under #95, the deduplicated output.\n- #97, the resolver groundwork.\n- The namespace re-export branch, committed locally and not yet pushed. Its full test run was interrupted by the slow `compile_fail` rebuild.\n\nYour call on swapping that test for the doctest pair is still open.\n\nresult: Caliper 0.3.0 is fully released, with 2 crates on crates.io and 13 npm packages, after 15 re-runs caused by Callisto 0.11's npm visibility check; #98 pins Callisto 0.12.0, which waits for npm and fixes this for future releases."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":384,"cache_read_input_tokens":767156,"output_tokens":610,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":84},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":384,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":610,"cache_read_input_tokens":767156,"cache_