{"parentUuid":"fe25c628-da52-43db-aa64-3a3b6f1ac85e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQ1vqb2nkoYf2LNxc6f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I dropped the change: the workflow keeps the `NPM_TOKEN` step, and I deleted the unpushed branch. Nothing else changed: #98 still only pins Callisto 0.12.0.\n\nOne thing to check on npmjs.com: adding a trusted publisher doesn't by itself block token publishing. But if any package's **Publishing access** is now \"require trusted publisher\" or \"disallow tokens\", the next release will hit the same 403 as before. Each package needs to keep allowing automation or granular tokens until Callisto supports OIDC.\n\nBack to step 2 (namespace re-exports): its branch is committed locally, and I still need to finish its test run and open the PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1807,"cache_read_input_tokens":779792,"output_tokens":224,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1807,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":224,"cache_read_input_tokens":779792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1807},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"442e7b29-f4fd-4ce9-8576-681c689d888e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJQ1vRHT9WN4SJkgPFZv","requestRef":"8f853d6e-048d-4663-9b61-7013dac663a9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0fc0ce22-460b-40c5-8bff-7d8b3acff3a5","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:41:51.210Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort