{"parentUuid":"0014d8f3-e2c8-46af-8d0b-aeecd7b1b2f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQFbNCJhbaAz5GKyp5P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Ready for you to merge** (all CI green):\n1. **#98**: pins Callisto 0.12.0, so the next release won't need a re-run per npm package. Merge before the next release.\n2. **#94 then #95**: the output-path speedups (Mantine 83 → 41 ms), then each distinct prop written once in the output (19.3 → 3.6 MB). #95 is stacked on #94.\n3. **#97**: resolves modules the way TypeScript does (Spectrum's unresolved types 586 → 180).\n\n**What I'm doing next**, in order:\n1. **Namespace re-exports (step 2):** committed locally; it needs a full test run, then a PR.\n2. **`ComponentProps<typeof X>` resolving to X's props:** today it resolves nothing, which leaves 226 shadcn components with no props. It's also what Radix wrappers will need.\n3. **Step 3, share resolved props in memory:** fixes the chakra blow-up (2.4 s, 3.4 GB) seen in the experiment.\n4. **Step 4, type-text fixes:** keep alias names instead of expanding conditional types, generic defaults, handler types, callback return types.\n5. **Step 5, the dependency loader:** behind a flag, with its ADRs.\n\n**Decisions for you:**\n- Replace the slow trybuild `compile_fail` test with the doctest pair? (I recommend yes.)\n- Should the rule that collapses large inherited prop sources also apply to sources declared in the project, like chakra's own style props? This only matters for step 5.\n- Dependabot PR #84 is failing CI; I can look at it if you want.\n\nUnless you'd rather change the order, I'll carry on with item 1."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_read_input_tokens":782143,"output_tokens":834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":266},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":782143,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c5ace375-7c5b-430a-9c13-11fa9814c296","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJQFahGLwMdkXmByP3xD","requestRef":"cec756f6-e2b9-450b-8d6f-0c3a5100d498","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e3cbe8bd-210d-422f-88a1-65c9384a9784","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:45:02.713Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
