{"parentUuid":"88c7a5c1-60bb-435e-9d34-46801aaea75c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJQiyzEzu1MkjHVXPk3u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Recommendation on the collapse rule: **apply it to dependency sources only, the way Storybook does, and don't collapse sources declared in the project. Fix chakra's size with in-memory sharing, and expose the rule as an option.** Reasons:\n\n- **Storybook parity.** react-component-meta, Storybook 11's default, collapses only sources inside `node_modules` (or `.d.ts`) with more than 30 props. Collapsing project sources would hide props Storybook shows.\n- **Who sees what.** In an app that *uses* chakra or Mantine, those style props come from `node_modules`, so they collapse anyway. Only in the design system's own repo are they project sources. There they're the library's own API, and its authors want them listed.\n- **The chakra blow-up is a cost problem, not a display one.** About 665 props per component cost 2.4 s and 3.4 GB because each component holds its own copy. Sharing resolved props in memory (step 3) fixes the cost, and #95's prop table already makes the output small. Hiding data to save memory would lose precision.\n- **An escape hatch:** a `collapseInheritedProps: \"dependencies\" | \"all\" | \"none\"` option with a threshold, defaulting to `\"dependencies\"`.\n\nI'll build it that way unless you say otherwise.\n\nPlan for the rest, as one stack so every PR's diff is only its own change:\n\n`main ← #94 ← #95 ← #97 ← namespace ← ComponentProps<typeof X> ← type-text fixes ← shared props ← loader`\n\nThe trybuild replacement and #98 stay independent off main, and I'll also look at the failing Dependabot PR #84. Starting by moving #97 onto #95:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":117,"cache_read_input_tokens":783046,"output_tokens":3756,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2649},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3756,"cache_read_input_tokens":783046,"cache_creation_input_tokens":117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b70ad5d0-66ac-463f-bd05-bb9404589813","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJQiyCchgjGL7aaBxhxe","requestRef":"a4c07475-884d-438d-972d-0c9ac1606186","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"666abf3e-d914-4460-9e94-2ac63605aa58","timestamp":"2026-10-23T02:51:39.681Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
