{"parentUuid":"a58a04ca-c39f-4f03-8e55-ff3e74310cca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRd3W2YWpoS26LWNoM9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RUsZiJSqcLbjdi7RPvhPrz","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/.changeset/namespace-reexports.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: patch\n---\n\n- **Namespace re-exports resolve:** a type reached through a namespace, such as `import { Menu as MenuPrimitive } from './ui'` and then `MenuPrimitive.RootProps`, now resolves when `./ui` re-exports the namespace (`export * as Menu from './menu'`, or `import * as menu from './menu'; export { menu as Menu }`) or declares it (`export namespace Menu`).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1455,"cache_read_input_tokens":791088,"output_tokens":982,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":63},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1455,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":982,"cache_read_input_tokens":791088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1455,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1455},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01RUsZiJSqcLbjdi7RPvhPrz":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/.changeset/namespace-reexports.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: patch\n---\n\n- **Namespace re-exports resolve:** a type reached through a namespace, such as `import { Menu as MenuPrimitive } from './ui'` and then `MenuPrimitive.RootProps`, now resolves when `./ui` re-exports the namespace (`export * as Menu from './menu'`, or `import * as menu from './menu'; export { menu as Menu }`) or declares it (`export namespace Menu`).\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d6368096-54fa-40f0-9e37-4446375c4c9e","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgJRd2ymtdYYRK2GGVjKZ","requestRef":"6b511459-3f21-41c4-8e9a-040c528072b0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5761718c-2cf7-496a-ad0d-9729261924e8","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:02:56.907Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
