{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","prNumber":99,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/99","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:03:23.249Z"}
{"parentUuid":"91b845f7-a149-49de-80b8-2afe47a063f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJReMmQ3nNkT2cCsiL2R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MuVBUzbFxhhkMvEdXUhGej","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_namespace.md","content":"Stacked on #97.\n\nA type reached through a namespace that a module re-exports didn't resolve. Radix's typings are written this way (`import * as menu from './menu'; export { menu as Menu }`), and shadcn imports them as `import { Menu as MenuPrimitive } from 'radix-ui'`. That's a dependency case for the loader; this PR makes the same shapes work between project files.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Extractor: `import * as ns from './a'; export { ns as Ns }` is recorded as `export * as Ns from './a'` (a `ReExportNamespace`), the way `import { A }; export { A }` already becomes a named re-export.\n- `resolve_reexport_chain` answers a member of a re-exported namespace: `Menu.Root` at a barrel with `export * as Menu from './menu'` steps to `Root` in `./menu`.\n- `resolve_to_canonical`: a member of a *named* import (`MenuPrimitive.RootProps` where `MenuPrimitive` is `Menu` from `./ui`) follows `Menu.RootProps` from `./ui`, so a namespace re-export or an `export namespace Menu` declaration answers it. Before, only `import * as` namespaces were followed.\n\n`ComponentProps<typeof MenuPrimitive.Root>` still resolves nothing: `ComponentProps<typeof X>` as a component's own props type never looks up component values, even local ones. That's the next PR.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `pipeline::tests::a_member_of_a_namespace_reexport_resolves_through_a_named_import`: all three spellings (`export * as`, `import * as` + `export { as }`, `export namespace`).\n- `extractor::tests::an_exported_namespace_import_is_a_namespace_reexport`\n- `cargo nextest run --workspace` (730 pass), `just lint doc-check typos`\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":792543,"output_tokens":1081,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1351,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1081,"cache_read_input_tokens":792543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1351,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1351},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01MuVBUzbFxhhkMvEdXUhGej":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_namespace.md","content":"Stacked on #97.\n\nA type reached through a namespace that a module re-exports didn't resolve. Radix's typings are written this way (`import * as menu from './menu'; export { menu as Menu }`), and shadcn imports them as `import { Menu as MenuPrimitive } from 'radix-ui'`. That's a dependency case for the loader; this PR makes the same shapes work between project files.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Extractor: `import * as ns from './a'; export { ns as Ns }` is recorded as `export * as Ns from './a'` (a `ReExportNamespace`), the way `import { A }; export { A }` already becomes a named re-export.\n- `resolve_reexport_chain` answers a member of a re-exported namespace: `Menu.Root` at a barrel with `export * as Menu from './menu'` steps to `Root` in `./menu`.\n- `resolve_to_canonical`: a member of a *named* import (`MenuPrimitive.RootProps` where `MenuPrimitive` is `Menu` from `./ui`) follows `Menu.RootProps` from `./ui`, so a namespace re-export or an `export namespace Menu` declaration answers it. Before, only `import * as` namespaces were followed.\n\n`ComponentProps<typeof MenuPrimitive.Root>` still resolves nothing: `ComponentProps<typeof X>` as a component's own props type never looks up component values, even local ones. That's the next PR.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `pipeline::tests::a_member_of_a_namespace_reexport_resolves_through_a_named_import`: all three spellings (`export * as`, `import * as` + `export { as }`, `export namespace`).\n- `extractor::tests::an_exported_namespace_import_is_a_namespace_reexport`\n- `cargo nextest run --workspace` (730 pass), `just lint doc-check typos`\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"083657ed-45f1-4aea-9855-783d7d6f34c2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJReMQpBK4YcEzd1GTHe","requestRef":"fe96cc1e-4523-46b3-aca8-faa018c9f4a0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d64bacf-9c6f-4f59-8047-8dca3b6dead1","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:03:17.056Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/namespace-reexports","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
