{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"a9e1c081-5dec-41f7-877c-f83d4c6e3cb7","snapshotMessageId":"ee0a29a3-9114-44b3-ace5-d511d1479e8e","trackingPath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_doctest.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-10-23T03:04:39.388Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp"},"timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:04:39.399Z"}
{"parentUuid":"a9e1c081-5dec-41f7-877c-f83d4c6e3cb7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b55acb97-c792-4184-b0f8-5f25384a2a9e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DibwMaaPe72wzJ3W8mxYEx","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_doctest.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"d339ac4d-3762-4ca4-90f6-472f570e174f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:04:39.440Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_doctest.md","content":"`tests/compile_fail.rs` checked with trybuild that a `ParsedProp` struct literal doesn't compile outside the crate, so props go through `ParsedProp::new` (which makes a prop with a default optional). trybuild compiles a separate crate against the whole dependency graph in `target/tests/trybuild`; whenever `Cargo.lock` changed (a branch switch), that one test took minutes locally.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `ParsedProp`'s doc comment carries the guard as a doctest pair: a `compile_fail` example with the struct literal, and a compiling example with `ParsedProp::new` that proves the imports and names are right, so the failing one can only fail on the literal. `cargo test --doc` (already in `just test-rust` and CI) builds them against the crate already built.\n- Removed `tests/compile_fail.rs`, `tests/compile_fail/` and the `trybuild` dev-dependency.\n\nTrade-off: trybuild compared the exact compiler error text; a stable `compile_fail` doctest only requires that compilation fails (`compile_fail,E0451` is nightly-only). The compiling twin covers the realistic failure, a typo in the example.\n\n## Verify\n\n`cargo test -p caliper-docgen-core --doc` (both `ParsedProp` doctests pass), `just test-rust`, `just lint doc-check machete typos`.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6120558a-7b3b-4776-b89e-f2886164aff9","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"test/doctest-seal","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":3,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a9e1c081-5dec-41f7-877c-f83d4c6e3cb7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"test/doctest-seal","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
