{"parentUuid":"29c95e82-9bbe-40fd-95e8-9adf7e8e15e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRwjFwKhTZPtrbTTGfd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MTnwF3fUjZW6jx2L1AHS82","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"/usr/bin/git push -q -u origin feat/component-props-of-typeof","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_read_input_tokens":820504,"output_tokens":2074,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":198},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2074,"cache_read_input_tokens":820504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01MTnwF3fUjZW6jx2L1AHS82":{"command":"/usr/bin/git push -q -u origin feat/component-props-of-typeof","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d494f43-31f8-413e-a1e8-0b8b6b427db6","apiBlockIndex":5,"requestId":"req_011CgJRwiq9K1x2EJJZRFhYo","requestRef":"316393f5-cabe-43f9-b52c-ea8021e10040","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"08ee93cb-7451-4fcb-8620-24f4dc1e0af6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:14.143Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/component-props-of-typeof","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"08ee93cb-7451-4fcb-8620-24f4dc1e0af6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJRwjFwKhTZPtrbTTGfd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EiEeJqtnKUSa1AmxfxHWoK","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_typeof.md","content":"Stacked on #99.\n\n`ComponentProps<typeof X>` used as a component's own props type went through the known-pattern table, which turned `typeof X` into a *type* named `X`; the lookup found nothing, since `X` is a component value, and the component got no props. In an `extends` clause the same reference already resolved through `component_props_of`, which finds the component and resolves its props type.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `resolve_props_chain` step 0.6: when the type is React's `ComponentProps`, `ComponentPropsWithoutRef` or `ComponentPropsWithRef` (`may_be_react_builtin`) and its argument is `typeof X`, resolve through `component_props_of`, the same code `extends` uses. `X` may be local, imported, or a member of an imported namespace (with #99).\n- A project's own `ComponentProps` type is still that declaration.\n\n## Effect (five benchmark projects, dependencies installed, before = #97)\n\n| Project | Unresolved types | Components with no props | Props |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| shadcn | 1,006 → 378 | 1,224 → 1,102 | 1,161 → 1,543 |\n| antd | 116 → 112 | 7 → 7 | 3,389 → 3,389 |\n| mantine, chakra, spectrum | unchanged | unchanged | unchanged |\n\nshadcn gains 7 unresolved-module diagnostics, all `@shadcn/react/*`: an unbuilt workspace package, reached now that these components look up their component's import. Components wrapping a Radix primitive (`ComponentProps<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>`) still need the dependency loader.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `pipeline::tests::component_props_of_typeof_a_component_is_that_components_props`: same-file (`React.ComponentProps<typeof PaginationLink>`), imported, namespace member, and a project-declared `ComponentProps` that must not change.\n- `cargo nextest run --workspace` (731 pass), fixture snapshots unchanged.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_read_input_tokens":820504,"output_tokens":2074,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":198},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2074,"cache_read_input_tokens":820504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EiEeJqtnKUSa1AmxfxHWoK":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_typeof.md","content":"Stacked on #99.\n\n`ComponentProps<typeof X>` used as a component's own props type went through the known-pattern table, which turned `typeof X` into a *type* named `X`; the lookup found nothing, since `X` is a component value, and the component got no props. In an `extends` clause the same reference already resolved through `component_props_of`, which finds the component and resolves its props type.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `resolve_props_chain` step 0.6: when the type is React's `ComponentProps`, `ComponentPropsWithoutRef` or `ComponentPropsWithRef` (`may_be_react_builtin`) and its argument is `typeof X`, resolve through `component_props_of`, the same code `extends` uses. `X` may be local, imported, or a member of an imported namespace (with #99).\n- A project's own `ComponentProps` type is still that declaration.\n\n## Effect (five benchmark projects, dependencies installed, before = #97)\n\n| Project | Unresolved types | Components with no props | Props |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| shadcn | 1,006 → 378 | 1,224 → 1,102 | 1,161 → 1,543 |\n| antd | 116 → 112 | 7 → 7 | 3,389 → 3,389 |\n| mantine, chakra, spectrum | unchanged | unchanged | unchanged |\n\nshadcn gains 7 unresolved-module diagnostics, all `@shadcn/react/*`: an unbuilt workspace package, reached now that these components look up their component's import. Components wrapping a Radix primitive (`ComponentProps<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>`) still need the dependency loader.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `pipeline::tests::component_props_of_typeof_a_component_is_that_components_props`: same-file (`React.ComponentProps<typeof PaginationLink>`), imported, namespace member, and a project-declared `ComponentProps` that must not change.\n- `cargo nextest run --workspace` (731 pass), fixture snapshots unchanged.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d494f43-31f8-413e-a1e8-0b8b6b427db6","apiBlockIndex":6,"requestId":"req_011CgJRwiq9K1x2EJJZRFhYo","requestRef":"316393f5-cabe-43f9-b52c-ea8021e10040","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"49f37eb8-c1ea-4992-96a3-8cb20a1fc0d9","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:21.129Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/component-props-of-typeof","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
