{"parentUuid":"40f78e75-1a2a-4665-9a01-fca564cb0c8f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01MTnwF3fUjZW6jx2L1AHS82","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"release-0.2.0\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"Bash\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/gabe/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.1.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":43},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2e243ac3-2afc-4eaa-bf94-9825675ec030","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:25.370Z","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/component-props-of-typeof","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"49f37eb8-c1ea-4992-96a3-8cb20a1fc0d9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b55acb97-c792-4184-b0f8-5f25384a2a9e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EiEeJqtnKUSa1AmxfxHWoK","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_typeof.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"b290a877-95db-4636-ac31-63a640386d1d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:25.433Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/pr_body_typeof.md","content":"Stacked on #99.\n\n`ComponentProps<typeof X>` used as a component's own props type went through the known-pattern table, which turned `typeof X` into a *type* named `X`; the lookup found nothing, since `X` is a component value, and the component got no props. In an `extends` clause the same reference already resolved through `component_props_of`, which finds the component and resolves its props type.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `resolve_props_chain` step 0.6: when the type is React's `ComponentProps`, `ComponentPropsWithoutRef` or `ComponentPropsWithRef` (`may_be_react_builtin`) and its argument is `typeof X`, resolve through `component_props_of`, the same code `extends` uses. `X` may be local, imported, or a member of an imported namespace (with #99).\n- A project's own `ComponentProps` type is still that declaration.\n\n## Effect (five benchmark projects, dependencies installed, before = #97)\n\n| Project | Unresolved types | Components with no props | Props |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| shadcn | 1,006 → 378 | 1,224 → 1,102 | 1,161 → 1,543 |\n| antd | 116 → 112 | 7 → 7 | 3,389 → 3,389 |\n| mantine, chakra, spectrum | unchanged | unchanged | unchanged |\n\nshadcn gains 7 unresolved-module diagnostics, all `@shadcn/react/*`: an unbuilt workspace package, reached now that these components look up their component's import. Components wrapping a Radix primitive (`ComponentProps<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>`) still need the dependency loader.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `pipeline::tests::component_props_of_typeof_a_component_is_that_components_props`: same-file (`React.ComponentProps<typeof PaginationLink>`), imported, namespace member, and a project-declared `ComponentProps` that must not change.\n- `cargo nextest run --workspace` (731 pass), fixture snapshots unchanged.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8d494f43-31f8-413e-a1e8-0b8b6b427db6","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"feat/component-props-of-typeof","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"49f37eb8-c1ea-4992-96a3-8cb20a1fc0d9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/component-props-of-typeof","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
