{"parentUuid":"abe4779f-db68-45eb-81e0-790e89e5442a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01HdWfu2GmtazVKgjNMgLrQJ","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"rtk gh pr create --base main --head docs/oxfmt-073-toml --title \\\"docs: format TOML examples in archived docs the way oxfmt 0.73 does\\\" --body \\\"Unblocks the Dependabot bump #84. oxfmt 0.73.0 formats \\\\`\\\\`\\\\`toml blocks inside Markdown (no column alignment around \\\\`=\\\\`, single-space trailing comments, short arrays on one line), so \\\\`just lint\\\\`'s Markdown check fails on five files in \\\\`docs/archive/\\\\`. Reformatted with oxfmt 0.73.0; the pinned 0.72.0 accepts the result too, so this lands first. Whitespace and layout only, inside TOML examples.\\n\\nAfter this merges, \\\\`@dependabot rebase\\\\` on #84 re-runs its CI. Its other bumps (radix, react, oxlint 1.88, vitest) pass: oxlint 1.88 reports nothing on the current sources.\\n\\nhttps://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\\\"\",\"dangerouslyDisableSandbox\":true}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":17},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bbfad029-478a-474a-90be-5e09b30cd2c1","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:07:50.754Z","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"docs/oxfmt-073-toml","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
