{"parentUuid":"abe1cdaa-6574-4f5e-b8d9-a0314bc32eea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJS3MkHz72e1wjgbrA17","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done so far, all non-draft PRs:\n\n| PR | What | Base |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| #97 | Resolve modules the way TypeScript does | main |\n| #99 | Namespace re-exports through named imports | #97 |\n| #101 | `ComponentProps<typeof X>` gives X's props (shadcn unresolved types 1,006 → 378) | #99 |\n| #100 | Doctests instead of trybuild | main |\n| #102 | Reformat archived docs for oxfmt 0.73; unblocks Dependabot #84 | main |\n| #98 | Pin Callisto 0.12.0 | main |\n\n**Running now:** a background fork is building step 4, the type-text fixes, as three PRs stacked on #101:\n1. Function types: lost callback return types, the made-up `(e: void)`, handler types wrapped as a parameter.\n2. Generic defaults.\n3. Keeping an alias's name when its expansion would print as raw conditional type text.\n\nEach PR will report how much closer the types get to RDT's, measured on all five projects.\n\n**Still to come:** step 3 (share resolved props in memory) stacks on the type-text PRs, then step 5 (the dependency loader, with its ADRs and the \"dependencies only\" collapse rule by default). Each starts when the PR below it is up.\n\n**For you:**\n- Merge #102, then comment `@dependabot rebase` on #84.\n- #98 and #100 can merge any time."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5928,"cache_read_input_tokens":827258,"output_tokens":587,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":101},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5928,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":827258,"cache_creation_i