{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":981,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"25763c9b-553c-4ffd-86c6-f656b4543fbd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJUNVHVYW9a4URJSzD5v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 4 landed as two stacked PRs. Together they raise exact type matches against RDT from 30.0% to 52.9% of 26,463 props, with no exact match lost.\n\n- **#103, function types:** callbacks keep their return types (261 → 2 wrong), the made-up `(e: void)` is gone (191 → 0), and handler types are no longer wrapped as a parameter (60 → 0). CI passes. It breaks the output format: `kind: \"eventHandler\"` becomes `kind: \"function\"`. The parse cache moves to schema 15.\n- **#104, alias names:** an alias over an unevaluated conditional or mapped type now prints by name, e.g. `StyleProp<MantineSpacing>`. That cut the \"alias expanded where RDT names it\" family from 15,868 to 2,429. Literal unions still expand, so enum controls are unchanged. CI was still running when I last checked.\n- **Generic defaults, dropped:** it added only 3 exact matches and lost 5 Mantine props that matched before. The work is kept locally, unpushed, on `fix/generic-defaults`.\n- **Remaining gap:** much of what still differs from RDT is alias arguments printed as written in source rather than evaluated. Closing that needs the type checker.\n\nStep 3, sharing resolved props in memory, is now running in the background as a PR stacked on #104. It must keep output byte-identical and measure time and memory with and without dependency loading; the experiment's chakra baseline was 2.4 s and 3.4 GB. Step 5, the loader, follows on top of it.\n\nCurrent stack: `main ← #97 ← #99 ← #101 ← #103 ← #104 ← (step 3) ← (step 5)`. #98, #100 and #102 are separate, based on main."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5886,"cache_read_input_tokens":840258,"output_tokens":591,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5886,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":591,"cache_read_input_tokens":840258,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5886,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5886},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1fa830cd-3f17-44de-95f1-fadb00a8b94a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJUNUsBxDCiNVrskHKce","requestRef":"9b6283c2-4599-4f4f-956c-56f2fdf2a1ef","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a0a50fc-1662-4813-b6b5-168976b7b7c2","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:39:00.262Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"perf/shared-props","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
