{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":981,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"645ec567-518d-48d3-858d-a67d847a91c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJXVsvpHUY79squ7uGQq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 3 is up as #105 (`perf/shared-props`, stacked on #104). Output is byte-identical, and memory drops on every project:\n\n| Project | Before | After |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| mantine | 74 ms / 164 MB | 45 ms / 108 MB |\n| spectrum | 110 ms / 355 MB | 97 ms / 195 MB |\n| chakra, with dependency loading | 2,122 ms / 3.0 GB | 377 ms / 1.3 GB |\n\nThat removes the chakra blow-up that was blocking the loader.\n\n- **How:** components point at shared props instead of copying them, and each interface chain is resolved once per run. The memo is reused only when everything its first resolution read matches; tests check that, and deliberately breaking each replay part makes a test fail.\n- **One deviation:** a memo recording keeps each distinct diagnostic once, not every copy. Keeping every copy reached 4.8 million diagnostics on chakra. The output deduplicates them anyway, so it can't change.\n- **Breaking (Rust API):** `ComponentEntry.props` now holds `Arc<ParsedProp>`.\n\nStep 5, the dependency loader, is now running in the background on top of #105, as three PRs:\n1. The ADRs: loading by name, the per-package export index, and the collapse rule.\n2. The loader behind `--load-dependencies` (off by default), with watch support and leak guards.\n3. The `collapseInheritedProps` option, defaulting to \"dependencies\".\n\nEach PR keeps output byte-identical with the flag off, and measures what the flag changes against RDT.\n\nCurrent stack: `main ← #97 ← #99 ← #101 ← #103 ← #104 ← #105 ← (loader PRs)`. Separately based on main: #98, #100 and #102."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5801,"cache_read_input_tokens":852904,"output_tokens":611,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5801,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":611,"cache_read_input_tokens":852904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5801,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5801},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"db2b8077-ad83-4dcb-a367-afaf9a11bde9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJXVsWkdX93z81ZGderK","requestRef":"b9804ac3-7cfc-4188-80e2-ca64322d34b3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6efc62d6-19d2-4e3a-ac9e-38c4364158b7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:20:01.097Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"docs/oxfmt-073-toml","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
