{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","id":"19b68e64-7a4a-4b69-a3a4-ca748799e63a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:07:30.368Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"271448d7498b4d5fe55b0ea54b6d59c68b067f06e446f041aafd1688e49cf33e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"23c5290c-8afe-431d-9785-684b8f0f11f6","keep":1250,"tail":["e137d8ab8b5007388e68b17128c2a16ed043e32c02d4ebb80e19e0f8656ae2d5","0cb9c30ba1c310eaa6f32c6fca6e010608f78420cb00a95dcf55348dea9a04d3","214c5a046f232a4d9c13b76035036e2cca7fdfa57e3e4f1033075b1edca4e73b"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1252,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"240a5e8e3166c210608a89de8a9e37ca305f42d9c20d28f12c686a22ab1107df"}
{"parentUuid":"c4006af0-77e5-426e-a3d9-3fdf26abcffd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJb8LrAFfjEd6pJiqd3N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dependency loading is done as three stacked PRs, all passing CI: #106 (ADRs 0010–0012), #107 (the loader, behind `--load-dependencies`) and #109 (`collapseInheritedProps`, defaulting to \"dependencies\"). With the flag off, output is byte-identical to the base on all 5 corpora, 5 mirrors and 21 fixtures.\n\n**With the flag on:**\n\n| Project | Unresolved types | Components with no props | Time | vs RDT with deps |\n| --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| mantine | 12 → 8 | 10 → 10 | 51 ms | 29× faster |\n| chakra | 323 → 25 | 144 → 4 | 390 ms | 42× faster |\n| shadcn | 378 → 55 | 1,102 → 753 | 86 ms | 37× faster |\n| antd | 112 → 58 | 7 → 6 | 47 ms | 39× faster |\n| spectrum | 180 → 172 | 18 → 18 | 88 ms | 29× faster |\n\n- Deterministic at 1, 4 and 18 threads; no package component or enum appears in the output.\n- In watch mode the result after an edit matches a cold run.\n- Building the on-disk index costs 0–7 ms the first time.\n\n**New along the way:** Radix-style `export { DialogContent as Content }` now keeps the local name, so those components are found. That's a breaking Rust API change, and the parse cache moves to schema 16.\n\n**Before turning the flag on by default:**\n1. **Chakra's own repo stays heavy:** 399k props, 27 MB output, and about 300 ms per watch edit. Its style props are project sources, so \"dependencies\" doesn't collapse them; \"all\" brings it to 5.5k props. Your call: keep the Storybook-matching default (what you approved) and accept that cost for a design system's own repo, or collapse large project sources too.\n2. **Alias names:** types that changed match RDT less often, mainly because we expand aliases RDT prints by name (`LucideIcon`).\n3. **A real bug:** recharts' event handlers overwrite the DOM ones (`onTimeUpdate` comes out wrong).\n4. **Watch:** a reinstall needs `rebuild()`. Track C's #111 (rebuild when the lockfile, `package.json` or tsconfig changes) covers part of this.\n\n**Other tracks, first PRs up:**\n- #110: Mantine payload-props fix (track A)\n- #108: NAPI in `worker_threads` (track B)\n- #111: watch rebuild on config changes (track C)\n\nEach track is still adding to its chain."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":150,"cache_read_input_tokens":888082,"output_tokens":890,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":150,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":890,"cache_read_input_tokens":888082,"cache_creation_input_tokens":150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":150},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"23687485-f39d-48f9-886b-de1238cec7f9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJb8LNPfjvjHKvKBbgYk","requestRef":"19b68e64-7a4a-4b69-a3a4-ca748799e63a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8cee1898-9db9-4014-85d4-fc55642a9c42","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:07:38.610Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"spike/napi-in-worker-threads","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
