{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:20:11.955Z","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>ac4ffd0d81fe4e197</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_013TW2YzkLjiELsj9ZRaZgTX</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper--claude-worktrees-release-0-2-0/ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675/tasks/ac4ffd0d81fe4e197.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Precision and detection fixes\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>I've opened all four stacked PRs. Each passed `cargo nextest run --workspace --exclude caliper-docgen-napi` and `just lint doc-check machete typos`, and was measured on the five corpora with a release build.\n\n| # | PR | Branch → base | Commit | Measured effect |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | [#110](https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/110) | `fix/factory-payload-props` → `main` | `b84bf107` | Only Mantine `OverflowList` changed: it now has its real props instead of the 5 payload keys. Other corpora unchanged. |\n| 2 | [#112](https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/112) | `fix/called-helpers-are-not-components` → #1 | `0b258af5` | React Spectrum drops from 1,384 to 1,359 components. All 25 removed are confirmed non-components (type renderers, `DropIndicatorWrapper` render callbacks, two inner render functions). Other corpora unchanged. |\n| 3 | [#113](https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/113) | `feat/exported-flag` → #2 | `7f202063` | Unexported components (`--format rdt` now omits these): Mantine 7 of 346, Chakra 2 of 600, shadcn 99 of 1,884, Ant Design 42 of 253, React Spectrum 194 of 1,359. |\n| 4 | [#115](https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/115) | `fix/rdt-file-path` → #3 | `364d12e3` | Every `--format rdt` component on all five corpora now has an absolute `filePath` that points to a real file. Before, none had the field. |\n\n**PR3:**\n- **Detection:** the issue's list of export forms missed `const Menu = Object.assign(MenuRoot, { Item: MenuItem })`, a common way to build compound components. PR3 handles it, so the root and its sub-components count as exported.\n- **Unexported verdicts:** every one I spot-checked was correct. Examples: Mantine `PasswordInputField`, Ant Design `ConfirmDialog` (the file default-exports a wrapper instead), and components built inside exported factory functions such as the inner `Calendar` in Ant Design's `generateCalendar`.\n- **Flag:** `--include-unexported` keeps unexported components in rdt and storybook output. Canonical output always keeps them, marked `exported: false`.\n- **Cache version:** the cache schema version goes from 14 to 15. This will likely conflict with #103, which also bumps it to 15; whichever merges second should move to 16.\n- **Snapshots:** the only change in the eight fixture snapshots is `\"exported\": true` on each component, because every fixture component is exported.\n\n**Tests and process:**\n- New tests sit next to related tests, not at the end of files. Each asserts exact values.\n- I ran the full test suite outside the sandbox: inside it, the watch-process tests can't receive file-change events. One run had transient failures in the `caliper-docgen-tsc-client` lifecycle tests, unrelated to these changes; the rerun passed all 726 tests.\n- I dropped nothing.\n\nChangesets are in `.changeset/`. Measurement scripts and PR bodies are in `/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/trackA/` (`compare.py`, `exported_counts.py`, `pr1.md`–`pr4.md`). This tmp folder is deleted with the job.\n\nresult: Opened stacked PRs #110 → #112 → #113 → #115 (factory payload props, helpers not treated as components, `exported` flag with rdt/storybook filtering, absolute `filePath` in rdt output), each tested, lint-clean and measured on five corpora.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>153214</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>174</tool_uses><duration_ms>1249194</duration_ms></usage>\n<worktree><worktreePath>/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-ac4ffd0d81fe4e197</worktreePath><worktreeBranch>worktree-agent-ac4ffd0d81fe4e197</worktreeBranch></worktree>\n</task-notification>"}
