{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":981,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"fbfa2e90-dbce-4507-9918-612183374f2a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJc6iLJEimQUMaKFPZWL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Track A is done: four stacked PRs off main, each tested, lint-clean and measured on all five corpora.\n\n| PR | Change | Effect |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| #110 | Mantine factory payload props | `OverflowList` gets its real props instead of 5 payload keys |\n| #112 (on #110) | Functions that are only called aren't components | Spectrum 1,384 → 1,359 components; all 25 removed checked as non-components |\n| #113 (on #112) | `exported` flag on every component | `--format rdt` now omits unexported ones (e.g. 194 on Spectrum, 99 on shadcn); `--include-unexported` keeps them; canonical output keeps everything, marked |\n| #115 (on #113) | `filePath` in `--format rdt` | Every component on all five corpora now has its file path |\n\n#113 also recognizes `const Menu = Object.assign(MenuRoot, { Item })`, so compound components built that way count as exported.\n\n**Merge-order note:** three open PRs bump the parse-cache schema version independently. #103 and #113 both set 15, and #107 sets 16. Whichever merges later needs its number moved up by one, or the cache golden test fails. That's one line plus the golden snapshot, and I can do it whenever you merge.\n\nTracks B (Storybook) and C (hardening and docs) are still running; #108 and #111 are their first PRs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3165,"cache_read_input_tokens":891020,"output_tokens":468,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3165,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":468,"cache_read_inpu