{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":981,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"286e18b5-41be-456d-a3e2-11af709311bd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJdHEtiCMEtFakxMfymf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Track C is done: four stacked PRs off main, `#111 ← #114 ← #116 ← #118`. Tests and lint pass on each.\n\n- **#111, watch rebuilds on config changes:** editing a tsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile now rebuilds the session, in the CLI watcher and the Vite plugin. That covers part of what the loader needs before it can be on by default.\n- **#114, `ensureFresh(sessionId)`:** for hosts with no file watcher, like the Storybook worker. It checks the files the session read and applies only what changed. Its result matches `update_file` and a cold run for an edit, a new file, a deletion and a tsconfig change.\n- **#116, CI gates scaled to project size:**\n  - Adds `scripts/scorecard.py`, which runs the five corpora at pinned commits, and a weekly or manual `scorecard.yml` workflow.\n  - The workflow fails if the branch is more than 1.1× slower than main, less than 10× faster than RDT, or more than 2.2× slower on double the code.\n  - Local run: 17–39× faster than RDT, and all gates pass.\n  - The workflow can't run in Actions until it's on main.\n- **#118, stale docs:** STATUS.md's cross-package claim is corrected. The TS 7.1 beta details are checked against the real package. The README speed claim now uses the reproducible scorecard's 17–39×. ADRs 0006 and 0007 were left unchanged, as accurate history.\n\n**Merge conflicts to expect:** #118 and #107 both correct the same STATUS.md claim, so whichever merges second needs a small conflict fix. The parse-cache schema version number also needs reconciling across #103, #107 and #113. I'll handle both as you merge.\n\nStill running: Track B (Storybook), resumed to finish the provider PR and the two after it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3265,"cache_read_input_tokens":899125,"output_tokens":621,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3265,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":899125,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3265,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3265},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dd4beaeb-60b6-455a-a917-7b7ab121b49f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJdHERBf2t11gDQBAwNs","requestRef":"277091ea-5bd1-42d0-9c96-1943cf1b8399","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7cbc0962-cc0e-4cf6-81a8-310f2a216af1","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:35:50.959Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/storybook-vite-docgen","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
