{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:49:37.239Z","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>bw6h01olb</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01SPRWtyCfnZzAmiaqgsbhjW</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper--claude-worktrees-release-0-2-0/ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675/tasks/bw6h01olb.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"Wait for CI on PR 120\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"}
