{"parentUuid":"f7782228-174b-44f1-a3a6-13e3f4a438f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJh6sdjFANRkvEGNVfnh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3602,"cache_read_input_tokens":912813,"output_tokens":1118,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":197},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3602,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1118,"cache_read_input_tokens":912813,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3602},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2119,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"c1832240-0a70-48e8-a630-193914c1556f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgJh6rYV2DBj5hCeS23ZB","requestRef":"604da347-251f-4434-9694-c3dd0e07a211","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"31d819e2-26d5-488e-a006-a499a10eef37","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:25:54.331Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"fix/zod-infer-unwrap","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"31d819e2-26d5-488e-a006-a499a10eef37","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJh6sdjFANRkvEGNVfnh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bug batch is done: three stacked fixes on #109, `#121 ← #122 ← #123`. Each has a test that fails without the fix, and the suite and lint pass.\n\n- **#121, JSDoc placement:** a comment now documents only the declaration directly after it, as in TypeScript. On a one-line function it used to land on the first prop. The old 120-byte window also turned license headers into component descriptions. This changes a few descriptions per corpus (mantine 11, antd 17, spectrum 27); every change I checked is an improvement.\n- **#122, merging props across an intersection:** when two members of an intersection declare the same prop, its type is now the intersection of both, confirmed against TypeScript's checker on shadcn. Before, one silently replaced the other. `extends` still lets the derived declaration win.\n  - **Limitation:** in the default curated mode (the CLI, Vite plugin and Storybook), recharts' `onTimeUpdate` still shows only recharts' type. React's own attribute declarations are only loaded in Full mode, and ADR 0010 skips them on purpose. Fixing that needs an amendment to that ADR.\n- **#123, `z.infer<typeof schema>`:** keeps its name instead of unwrapping to `typeof schema[\"_output\"]`, and `z.infer<Parsed>` evaluates to the real object type. That changes 11–53 props per corpus, each matching how TypeScript prints the type.\n- **Render props printed as `=> void`:** dropped, because #103 had already fixed it; the Storybook track saw the bug on main.\n\n**Open: 25 PRs in five chains plus three independent.** I'd stop adding to them now. Each new PR increases the conflict risk, and the parse-cache schema number already needs reconciling across #103, #107 and #113.\n\n**Merge order:**\n1. The independent PRs #98, #100 and #102, then comment `@dependabot rebase` on #84.\n2. The main stack, `#97 → … → #109 → #121 → #122 → #123`.\n3. Track C (`#111 → #114 → #116 → #118`) and Track A (`#110 → #112 → #113 → #115`).\n4. Track B (`#108 → #117 → #119 → #120`) last, since the provider should switch to #114's `ensureFresh`.\n\nI'll fix the conflicts and cache-schema numbers as each one lands.\n\n**Decisions still waiting on you:**\n1. Should string defaults keep their source quotes (`'md'`) to match Storybook's React docgen?\n2. Should large project-declared sources (chakra's own style props) collapse by default?\n3. Should we amend ADR 0010 so curated mode loads React's attribute declarations? That fixes the handler merge.\n4. When should dependency loading become the default?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3602,"cache_read_input_tokens":912813,"output_tokens":1118,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":197},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3602,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1118,"cache_read_input_tokens":912813,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3602},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c1832240-0a70-48e8-a630-193914c1556f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJh6rYV2DBj5hCeS23ZB","requestRef":"604da347-251f-4434-9694-c3dd0e07a211","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f0064e20-061b-4d74-9ffd-c538d4e0730a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:26:02.258Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high",