{"parentUuid":"eef7e9c2-89d1-4f3f-83b9-c3c2d04766ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKXTe2qQDgBFKZoWLeM5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K2jCJZNBSSheCSxhfAVPWa","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/pipeline-orchestration.md","old_string":"<<<<<<< HEAD\n- **Watch mode does not observe `node_modules`.** A change to a tsconfig, jsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above a source directory (`WatchSession::is_resolution_config`) does reach `update_file`, which rebuilds the session from scratch (`Revision::rebuilt`) and returns the full delta; watchers add those files with `resolution_config_files()`. A package edited in place without a lockfile change still needs `rebuild()`.\n=======\n- **The dependency layer only grows during a watch session.** A demand an edit removes leaves its declarations loaded; they change no output (a name nothing references is never looked up), and `rebuild()` starts from a fresh layer.\n\n- **Watch mode does not observe `tsconfig.json`, `package.json` or `node_modules` changes.** They change module resolution for every component; restart the session (or call `rebuild()`) after editing them.\n>>>>>>> fix/rdt-file-path","new_string":"- **The dependency layer only grows during a watch session.** A demand an edit removes leaves its declarations loaded; they change no output (a name nothing references is never looked up), and a rebuild (a configuration change below, or `rebuild()`) starts from a fresh layer.\n\n- **Watch mode does not observe `node_modules`.** A change to a tsconfig, jsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above a source directory (`WatchSession::is_resolution_config`) does reach `update_file`, which rebuilds the session from scratch (`Revision::rebuilt`) and returns the full delta; watchers add those files with `resolution_config_files()`. A package edited in place without a lockfile change still needs `rebuild()`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1446,"cache_read_input_tokens":938422,"output_tokens":1665,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":209},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1446,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1665,"cache_read_input_tokens":938422,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1446},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01K2jCJZNBSSheCSxhfAVPWa":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/pipeline-orchestration.md","old_string":"<<<<<<< HEAD\n- **Watch mode does not observe `node_modules`.** A change to a tsconfig, jsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above a source directory (`WatchSession::is_resolution_config`) does reach `update_file`, which rebuilds the session from scratch (`Revision::rebuilt`) and returns the full delta; watchers add those files with `resolution_config_files()`. A package edited in place without a lockfile change still needs `rebuild()`.\n=======\n- **The dependency layer only grows during a watch session.** A demand an edit removes leaves its declarations loaded; they change no output (a name nothing references is never looked up), and `rebuild()` starts from a fresh layer.\n\n- **Watch mode does not observe `tsconfig.json`, `package.json` or `node_modules` changes.** They change module resolution for every component; restart the session (or call `rebuild()`) after editing them.\n>>>>>>> fix/rdt-file-path","new_string":"- **The dependency layer only grows during a watch session.** A demand an edit removes leaves its declarations loaded; they change no output (a name nothing references is never looked up), and a rebuild (a configuration change below, or `rebuild()`) starts from a fresh layer.\n\n- **Watch mode does not observe `node_modules`.** A change to a tsconfig, jsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above a source directory (`WatchSession::is_resolution_config`) does reach `update_file`, which rebuilds the session from scratch (`Revision::rebuilt`) and returns the full delta; watchers add those files with `resolution_config_files()`. A package edited in place without a lockfile change still needs `rebuild()`."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"96e00558-8f8f-4dc3-8939-902f3d9c08ca","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgKXTdcYPwMpsupbm54wz","requestRef":"2fb638fa-74d9-41af-ba5b-a34112e81b2a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1bf5e135-e317-49f2-ae58-98df9879d346","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:00:08.217Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/watch-rebuild-on-config","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"1bf5e135-e317-49f2-ae58-98df9879d346","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKXTe2qQDgBFKZoWLeM5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NpEDj9aMRo2fQzb58uB7xf","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/packages/vite-plugin/README.md","old_string":"<<<<<<< HEAD\nA change to a tsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above `srcDirs` (installing a package, editing `paths`) re-extracts everything and arrives as an ordinary update event.\n\nIn `vite build --watch`, a change to any file under `srcDirs`, or to that configuration, triggers a rebuild, even one no bundle module imports. A build fails if extraction fails.\n=======\nPass `loadDependencies: true` to resolve the types your props import from installed packages; by default they stay named references.\n\nIn `vite build --watch`, a change to any file under `srcDirs` triggers a rebuild, even one no bundle module imports. A build fails if extraction fails.\n>>>>>>> fix/rdt-file-path","new_string":"A change to a tsconfig, `package.json` or lockfile in or above `srcDirs` (installing a package, editing `paths`) re-extracts everything and arrives as an ordinary update event.\n\nPass `loadDependencies: true` to resolve the types your props import from installed packages; by default they stay named references.\n\nIn `vite build --watch`, a change to any file under `srcDirs`, or to that configuration, triggers a rebuild, even one no bundle module imports. A build fails if extraction fails."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1446,"cache_read_input_tokens":938422,"output_tokens":1665,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":209},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_cr