{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","hash":"4c57170c28def2e8c996e7ffeb1c332e126c2de8f422f112641dba21ef86e3f2","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019SKmVa1XZDuofTYZXmUxjh","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"<<<<<<< HEAD\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are fully tested. Config file loading, watch mode (including rebuilds on config changes and polling with `ensure_fresh`), plugin architecture, TOON token-optimized output format, JSON schema export, LSP server scaffold, and bounded atomic DTS caching are implemented and verified.\n\n**Types from other packages.** Imports resolve to any file under a source directory, `.d.ts` included, so a monorepo whose packages are all source directories resolves across them. From `node_modules`, only `@types/react` and TypeScript's own lib files are read. A prop whose type comes from any other installed package stays unresolved with an `UNRESOLVABLE_IMPORT` warning. Loading dependency declarations is in review behind `--load-dependencies` (#107, #109).\n=======\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are fully tested. Config file loading, watch mode, plugin architecture, TOON token-optimized output format, JSON schema export, LSP server scaffold, and bounded atomic DTS caching are all fully implemented and verified.\n\nTypes imported from packages resolve only when they are React builtins, known shortcuts or reachable through `@types/react`; any other package type stays a named reference with an \"unresolved type\" warning. `--load-dependencies` (config `loadDependencies`, NAPI and Vite `loadDependencies`) loads the declarations those names point to, off by default while its output is checked against RDT (ADR 0010).\n>>>>>>> ci/size-normalized-gates","new_string":"Core extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are fully tested. Config file loading, watch mode (including rebuilds on config changes and polling with `ensure_fresh`), plugin architecture, TOON token-optimized output format, JSON schema export, LSP server scaffold, and bounded atomic DTS caching are implemented and verified.\n\n**Types from other packages.** Imports resolve to any file under a source directory, `.d.ts` included, so a monorepo whose packages are all source directories resolves across them. By default, from `node_modules` only `@types/react` and TypeScript's own lib files are read, and a prop whose type comes from any other installed package stays a named reference with an `UNRESOLVABLE_IMPORT` warning. `--load-dependencies` (config, NAPI and Vite `loadDependencies`) loads the declarations those names point to; it is off by default while its output is checked against RDT (ADR 0010)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CftCoLs784jnU7WzRTye2Z","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"pnpm exec oxfmt --check docs/STATUS.md 2>&1 | tail -1; /usr/bin/git add -A","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BVhLEewCpETuRtDBGz5VCe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"/usr/bin/git commit -q --no-edit","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011ML6xPSxWHicAMqJMZMnXq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"/usr/bin/git push -q origin docs/status-and-ts7","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JbdaUyTbdq9vkXk1kLJgRV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/restack.py 22","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
