 output always keeps them, marked `exported: false`.","new_string":"    /// Keep components their module doesn't export in `--format rdt`, which omits them by default as\n    /// react-docgen-typescript does. Canonical output always keeps them, marked `exported: false`."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"76772a81-4dd9-4205-95e7-516da7ec3f78","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgKY61FYNY3Qog2RKse9q","requestRef":"d6396f51-24fb-41b5-bfd2-1d5eb7b06225","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b43a6af-2608-45a1-a554-0bf22e019a32","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:08:17.103Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"7b43a6af-2608-45a1-a554-0bf22e019a32","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKY61cNyZSwJdx29Jm2X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TmWxrJvVAyyMaqMzQXoxwE","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/serialization-formats.md","old_string":"RDT and Storybook output hold only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach RDT component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does. Storybook format leaves it out.","new_string":"`serialize` holds only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1487,"cache_read_input_tokens":148844,"output_tokens":927,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":71},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1487,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":927,"cache_read_input_tokens":148844,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1487,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1487},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":