{"parentUuid":"7857e9a9-47cb-45d6-b7d0-437d8dfb53b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fb563e85-80fa-4200-bf18-7a747f7a254b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TmWxrJvVAyyMaqMzQXoxwE","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/serialization-formats.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"9ab3cdc9-282a-4840-ba9f-dc1efeb9186d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:08:21.237Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/serialization-formats.md","oldString":"RDT and Storybook output hold only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach RDT component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does. Storybook format leaves it out.","newString":"`serialize` holds only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":16,"oldLines":9,"newStart":16,"newLines":9,"lines":[" "," Two entry points share one projection: `serialize` (`--format rdt`) applies RDT's default `skipChildrenPropWithoutDoc` (`omits`), and `docgen_info` (the NAPI `sessionDocgenInfo`, feeding the Storybook provider) keeps an undocumented `children`, because Storybook 11's React docgen lists it."," ","-RDT and Storybook output hold only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.","+`serialize` holds only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one."," ","-Each RDT component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does. Storybook format leaves it out.","+Each component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does."," "," ### The `enum`-shape convention (`type_json`)"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7857e9a9-47cb-45d6-b7d0-437d8dfb53b1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
