{"parentUuid":"a8e8358b-16be-41c6-9662-7660e687d9c8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01P6EwiSwD2CSyKdc2nRhim5","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"sed -i '' 's#(which govern the human/RDT/Storybook paths below)#(which govern the human/RDT paths below)#; s#(machine-readable canonical vs\\\\. human/RDT/Storybook-formatted)#(machine-readable canonical vs. human/RDT-formatted)#' docs/architecture/cli-commands.md && rtk grep -n 'Storybook' docs/architecture/cli-commands.md | head\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":15},"type":"attachment","uuid":"da7456e4-aae9-4874-909e-50314cfb97c6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:08:21.257Z","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"82785482-3444-424b-848a-12a2fbb14898","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fb563e85-80fa-4200-bf18-7a747f7a254b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P6EwiSwD2CSyKdc2nRhim5","type":"tool_result","content":"65:## The RDT/Storybook serializers are CLI-crate code, not core\n67:`serialize_rdt` delegates to `caliper_docgen_core::pipeline::rdt`, which the NAPI binding shares. Its `methods: []` field is a deliberate no-op documented inline: \"this tool doesn't extract class methods, and RDT consumers (Storybook's docgen addon) only ever read it for class components\" — not a placeholder for a future feature, a permanent constant matching what RDT-format consumers actually need. `rdt::type_json` reproduces RDT's specific `{\"name\": \"enum\", \"value\": [...]}` convention for literal unions specifically so prop-table renderers that pattern-match `type.name === \"enum\"` (a common Storybook addon integration point) render a `<select>` control — this is copying an external format's quirk deliberately, not house style bleeding in.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ab213aab-3d99-4870-9abd-fc86efc57c80","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:08:22.304Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"65:## The RDT/Storybook serializers are CLI-crate code, not core\n67:`serialize_rdt` delegates to `caliper_docgen_core::pipeline::rdt`, which the NAPI binding shares. Its `methods: []` field is a deliberate no-op documented inline: \"this tool doesn't extract class methods, and RDT consumers (Storybook's docgen addon) only ever read it for class components\" — not a placeholder for a future feature, a permanent constant matching what RDT-format consumers actually need. `rdt::type_json` reproduces RDT's specific `{\"name\": \"enum\", \"value\": [...]}` convention for literal unions specifically so prop-table renderers that pattern-match `type.name === \"enum\"` (a common Storybook addon integration point) render a `<select>` control — this is copying an external format's quirk deliberately, not house style bleeding in.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"76772a81-4dd9-4205-95e7-516da7ec3f78","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":128,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"82785482-3444-424b-848a-12a2fbb14898","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
