{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","hash":"5305b55d1d9bf7725528a36546abca12944510d00cf6ab4c7d081b66b3882469","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UYPWP5nNiHH1c7sW6s7TCJ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/crates/cli/src/main.rs","old_string":"    /// Keep components their module doesn't export in `--format rdt` and `--format storybook`, which omit them by\n    /// default as react-docgen-typescript does. Canonical output always keeps them, marked `exported: false`.","new_string":"    /// Keep components their module doesn't export in `--format rdt`, which omits them by default as\n    /// react-docgen-typescript does. Canonical output always keeps them, marked `exported: false`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TmWxrJvVAyyMaqMzQXoxwE","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/serialization-formats.md","old_string":"RDT and Storybook output hold only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach RDT component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does. Storybook format leaves it out.","new_string":"`serialize` holds only components with `exported: true`, unless `--include-unexported` is passed. react-docgen-typescript documents only a module's exports, so a file-local helper component would otherwise appear in RDT-shaped output where RDT never puts one.\n\nEach component carries `filePath`, the absolute path of its source file, as RDT's `ComponentDoc` does."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P6EwiSwD2CSyKdc2nRhim