","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"c3ef53c2-610e-494f-9924-327a4486a5f2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fb563e85-80fa-4200-bf18-7a747f7a254b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RrCQhY3fY9XEwwo9FpVEMZ","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/cli-commands.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"7d69c648-093b-405f-9288-fc96bd67243c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:08:27.081Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/cli-commands.md","oldString":"## The RDT/Storybook serializers are CLI-crate code, not core","newString":"## The RDT serializer is core code the CLI and the binding share","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":62,"oldLines":7,"newStart":62,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," **`extract --json` intentionally ignores `--out`/`--format`.** `ExtractArgs::json`'s doc comment (`main.rs:103-107`) states this precisely: `--json` is \"the canonical schema, compact, always to stdout, ignoring --out/--format (which govern the human/RDT paths below), and suppresses the human-readable summary/diagnostics.\" This is a deliberate two-mode split (machine-readable canonical vs. human/RDT-formatted), not an oversight where `--json --out foo.json` should have written to the file — it never will, by design."," ","-## The RDT/Storybook serializers are CLI-crate code, not core","+## The RDT serializer is core code the CLI and the binding share"," "," `serialize_rdt` delegates to `caliper_docgen_core::pipeline::rdt`, which the NAPI binding shares. Its `methods: []` field is a deliberate no-op documented inline: \"this tool doesn't extract class methods, and RDT consumers (Storybook's docgen addon) only ever read it for class components\" — not a placeholder for a future feature, a permanent constant matching what RDT-format consumers actually need. `rdt::type_json` reproduces RDT's specific `{\"name\": \"enum\", \"value\": [...]}` convention for literal unions specifically so prop-table renderers that pattern-match `type.name === \"enum\"` (a common Storybook addon integration point) render a `<select>` control — this is copying an external format's quirk deliberately, not house style bleeding in."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c3ef53c2-610e-494f-9924-327a4486a5f2","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
