{"parentUuid":"69b82ccb-5f8e-4257-b4de-565f9f51ae57","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKYCoNcSt9j3Vrs1cvyb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've restacked all 27 open PRs into one linear chain. Deleting the 12 stale remote branches was blocked by the permission check, so that part is still to do.\n\n**Stack** (each PR targets the one before it): #98 → #102 → #100 → #97 → #99 → #101 → #103 → #104 → #105 → #106 → #107 → #109 → #121 → #122 → #123 → #110 → #112 → #113 → #115 → #111 → #114 → #116 → #118 → #108 → #117 → #119 → #120. GitHub reports every PR as mergeable, and CI is still running on the PRs I just pushed.\n\n**Conflicts I resolved on the last three:**\n- **#117:**\n  - RDT output now includes `filePath` and leaves out unexported components unless asked; this logic moved into core, which the binding also uses.\n  - The binding, watch session and type declarations keep both PRs' additions.\n  - Checks: all 771 Rust tests, 18 NAPI tests, the TypeScript and integration tests, and lint pass.\n  - `a_signal_restores_the_terminal_mode_the_session_changed` failed once and passed on rerun; it's still a known flaky test.\n- **#119:**\n  - Merged the Vite plugin README and options from both PRs.\n  - The merged `src/index.ts` was over the 300-line lint limit, so I moved the update event type into a new `src/update.ts`.\n  - Lint, the 48 unit tests, the 20 integration tests and the build pass.\n- **#120:**\n  - Kept the unexported-component test, now covering RDT only.\n  - Updated the `--include-unexported` help text, its CLI help test and two architecture docs, which still mentioned `--format storybook`.\n  - All tests pass.\n\n**Cleanup:**\n- **Remote branches:** these 12 belong to PRs that already merged. To delete them, run:\n  ```\n  ! git push origin --delete chore/callisto-0.10 chore/ignore-tempfile-dirs ci/thin-jobs-and-coverage feat/oxc-0.151 fix/child-interface-prop-override fix/html-attributes-typo fix/proto-only-toolchain-setup fix/release-builds fix/ts7-lib-resolution fix/watch-lifecycle fix/watch-session-diagnostics test/cli-black-box-coverage\n  ```\n- **`fix/symbol-precedence` (#89):** closed without merging; I kept it for you to decide.\n- **Local branches:** I kept `exp/dependency-types`, `fix/generic-defaults` and the two `scratch/shared-props-deps*` branches.\n\nresult: All 27 open PRs are restacked into one linear chain (#98 → … → #120), all mergeable, with CI still running; deleting 12 merged remote branches is blocked and needs the command above."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":160020,"output_tokens":1176,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":227},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":776,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1176,"cache_read_input_tokens":160020,"cache_creation_input_tokens":776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":776},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ae27510a-f7b5-491e-988a-e90e77910a8c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgKYCo2HTggJvDjQu1TAD","requestRef":"b6e12deb-df74-4aef-aa16-897c14839cfa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f8af3891-0572-4287-87b6-926c8eaa5345","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:09:57.897Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version"