{"parentUuid":"4873613c-c489-456b-9e9b-bc8164351222","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKaSBmrL3XffjkRzXdDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1598,"cache_read_input_tokens":236322,"output_tokens":1500,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":750},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1598,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1500,"cache_read_input_tokens":236322,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1598,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1598},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":14793,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"74843919-01da-46ee-a44d-457e35d33906","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgKaSBSkdLs1HKTguHtka","requestRef":"4190a0f3-e877-49ed-b2c9-ad9a6b0d2473","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b680e477-a913-41a0-9f2b-53903c7afc60","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:39:16.741Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"b680e477-a913-41a0-9f2b-53903c7afc60","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKaSBmrL3XffjkRzXdDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, all three fail, and the cause in #119 and #120 is now fixed.\n\n**1. Vite integration test (#119, #120): fixed.** When I resolved #117's merge conflicts, I put `filePath` into `__docgenInfo`, so the test's `Button` had 6 keys instead of 5. `filePath` now appears only in `--format rdt`, which is what #115 intended. I pushed the fix on #117 and merged it forward into #119 and #120. Locally, all 7 integration tests pass and lint is clean; CI is rerunning.\n\n**2. `watch_stays_idle_when_stdin_is_not_a_terminal` (#116, #118, #108, #119): not fixed, cause unconfirmed.**\n- On Linux CI, the idle watch process used about 2s of CPU in a 3s window; the limit is 2s.\n- It started with #111 (`feat/watch-rebuild-on-config`). It failed on 5 of the 8 restacked runs from #111 upward and never on branches below it. #116 and #118 change no Rust code.\n- On macOS the same binary uses 0.00s of CPU per idle second, and the Docker daemon isn't running, so I couldn't reproduce it on Linux.\n- My leading theory:\n  - #111 adds any `package.json`, tsconfig or lockfile found above the source dirs to watchexec's watch set.\n  - On Linux, watchexec then also watches each such file's parent directory.\n  - If one of those files sits in `/tmp` or `/` on the CI runner, the watcher would receive an event for every temp dir that parallel tests create and delete. That would make the CPU use depend on timing, which matches the intermittent failures.\n  - This is unproven: I haven't confirmed such a file exists on the runner.\n\nDeciding the fix needs one Linux run. A one-off CI step that lists those files above the test's temp dir would settle it. Tell me if you want me to push it on a scratch branch.\n\nresult: In #119 and #120 the Vite integration failure (`filePath` in `__docgenInfo`) is fixed and pushed, CI is rerunning, and the Linux-only watch CPU test in #116/#118/#108/#119 still fails intermittently from #111 with its cause unconfirmed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1598,"cache_read_input_tokens":236322,"output_tokens":1500,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":750},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1598,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1500,"cache_read_input_tokens":236322,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1598,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1598},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"74843919-01da-46ee-a44d-457e35d33906","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgKaSBSkdLs1HKTguHtka","requestRef":"4190a0f3-e877-49ed-b2c9-ad9a6b0d2473","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9578d6df-fc20-431b-ae86-2f7c055e4953","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:39:16.746Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"chore/remove-storybook-format","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
