{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","id":"05163896-3800-4a06-972f-adab9c637037","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:03:15.067Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"271448d7498b4d5fe55b0ea54b6d59c68b067f06e446f041aafd1688e49cf33e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"48a20674-ddd3-4f40-87ac-28483dccb218","keep":365,"tail":["d4cf4310168a3ee3f6d9ad3f2b352c20036614f94a1b83fac86cef33e7d6a51c","6953ad2ea3e9750b4b636a5c246560a4ddfd599b421b27e5ee10b2de6c0758a3","15cc44e98e480d899ac677776cd55f08660b019ea59804ad2dc0a62394d13e07"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",367,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"75143ab6c9f84f7cfd1118116ea64bf43365912d369dd80d83eb62359e6c21ef"}
{"parentUuid":"4ca7bb04-d44b-4369-8d04-6b3671c22eb7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKcHMEqwnwgDzPVfhYo9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CI now passes on all 27 PRs in the stack (#98 → #120). The four that were still failing (#116, #118, #108, #120) all had the same cause, a real bug in `caliper-docgen watch` on Linux rather than a flaky test.\n\n**The bug:** on Linux, saving one file sent watch into an endless loop.\n- Applying a change reads the file, and Linux's file watcher reports that read as an event, which watch then applied again.\n- The idle process used about 1.2 CPU cores and opened the file around 600 times a second, printing the same component update over and over.\n- macOS doesn't report file reads as events, so it never happened locally.\n\n**The fix:** watch now ignores read events. It's on #111 with a unit test covering both kinds of event, and I merged it into the 8 PRs above it.\n\n**How it was checked:** on a Linux CI runner, one edit now produces one update and the process then uses no CPU. Locally, all tests pass except `a_signal_restores_the_terminal_mode_the_session_changed`, the known flaky test. It fails only on macOS when tests run in parallel, passed 5 of 5 times on its own, and hasn't failed in CI. Lint is clean.\n\n**Cleanup for you:** I can't delete remote branches (the permission check blocks it), so `scratch/watch-idle-diag` is still on GitHub. It only holds the diagnostic workflow and isn't meant to be merged. Delete it along with the 12 already-merged branches from before:\n```\n! git push origin --delete scratch/watch-idle-diag chore/callisto-0.10 chore/ignore-tempfile-dirs ci/thin-jobs-and-coverage feat/oxc-0.151 fix/child-interface-prop-override fix/html-attributes-typo fix/proto-only-toolchain-setup fix/release-builds fix/ts7-lib-resolution fix/watch-lifecycle fix/watch-session-diagnostics test/cli-black-box-coverage\n```\n\nresult: CI is green on all 27 stacked PRs after fixing a Linux-only endless loop in `caliper-docgen watch` (on #111, merged up the stack and verified on a Linux runner)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":281424,"output_tokens":727,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":281424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4f6813a2-455d-41a0-8e4e-d2506aeafcec","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgKcHLsXEf32T14f1mRZo","requestRef":"05163896-3800-4a06-972f-adab9c637037","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a54c438-f88b-4654-b44c-043520acd07d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:03:22.430Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"scratch/watch-idle-diag","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
