ameter but {reason}\"),\n329\t                                        func.span,\n330\t                                    );\n331\t                                }\n332\t                            } else if let Some((props_name, type_args)) =\n333\t                                self.extract_type_name_from_type(&type_ann.type_annotation)\n334\t                            {\n335\t                                if func.params.items.len() > 1 {\n336\t                                    self.takes_a_second_parameter.insert(name.into());\n337\t                                }\n338\t                                let (description, tags) = self.find_jsdoc_with_tags(func.span.start);\n339\t                                let param_defaults = self.extract_param_defaults(&func.params);\n340\t                                self.data.component_mappings.push(\n341\t                                    ComponentMapping::new(\n342\t                                        name.to_owned(),\n343\t                                        props_name,\n344\t                                        self.file_path.clone(),\n345\t                                        func.span.start,\n346\t                                        func.span.end,\n347\t                                        DetectionRule::FunctionDeclaration,\n348\t                                    )\n349\t                                    .with_props_type_args(type_args)\n350\t                                    .with_doc(description, tags)\n351\t                                    .with_param_defaults(param_defaults),\n352\t                                );\n353\t                            } else {\n354\t                                self.record_skip(\n355\t                                    DiagnosticCode::SkippedCandidate,\n356\t                                    format!(\n357\t                                        \"'{name}' is a PascalCase function declaration whose first param's type \\\n358\t      