{"parentUuid":"a73cbdd5-cf98-4447-9b74-73547ca146c6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Concise","turnReminder":"Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"69a75272-c4c0-47aa-803d-b8a80b7b52bc","timestamp":"2026-10-23T20:20:02.373Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nConcise output style is active. Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/wrapper-callee-result","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","hash":"3d5d3ee2aa0b1617f88446f168845c763969b7fe03eef9032e4f76e645df1fa4","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QCpBZgek5cnMMVJG7VxfZE","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/docs/architecture/resolver-type-resolution.md","old_string":"## The three-tier data model this resolver operates on\n","new_string":"## Wrapper callees (`resolver/callee.rs`)\n\nA `wrapperTypeArgument` component's props come from the type argument the extractor selected (`extractor/wrapper.rs`), plus what its callee's result type adds. The extractor records every generic function's result in `SourceData::function_results`: the return annotation, or the type its only top-level `return … as T` asserts. `callee::result_props` binds the callee's type parameters to the call's type arguments, follows aliases to the first React component type (`NamedExoticComponent<P>`, `FC<P>`, a call signature, …) and adds P's inline object members (`{ component?: any; renderRoot?: … }`) that the component doesn't already have. Other members of P (`Payload['props']`, `RefAttributes<…>`) are left to the selection, so this never warns. The callee's file is a recorded dependency, so editing the factory re-resolves the components it builds; `follow_reexports` treats a recorded function as a declaration, so `export *` barrels reach it.\n\n**Gap:** a result type asserted through an alias declared inside the function body (Mantine's `polymorphicFactory`) is not reachable.\n\n## The three-tier data model this resolver operates on\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q5ig7UPrDEhj5f7kQHkaoc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0/.changeset/wrapper-callee-result-props.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: patch\n---\n\n**A wrapper-built component gets the props its factory's result type adds:** `const Button = factory<ButtonFactory>(…)` now also lists the props the type `factory` returns declares beyond the payload, such as Mantine's `component` and `renderRoot`, as react-docgen-typescript does. The factory may be reached through `export *` barrels, and editing it updates the components it builds in watch mode. On Mantine's core package, 360 missing props are now reported.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F4EvA7k7PqSgkcAFGbpSnw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"just lint doc-check typos > \"$TMPDIR/lint.log\" 2>&1; echo \"lint exit $?\"; grep -iE '^error|Diff in' \"$TMPDIR/lint.log\" | head -5","timeout":600000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
