{"parentUuid":"563fec3a-9ebe-4f1e-81b0-1bb33945acbc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKnkUbHGe75Dv1SPe3qG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three tracks are done. Four PRs are open, and #84 (Dependabot) is now green too.\n\n| PR | What | CI |\n|---|---|---|\n| #126 | Fixes the flaky macOS signal test: it now sends SIGTERM only once watch's signal handling is up | green |\n| #127 | String defaults keep their source quotes (`'md'`), matching react-docgen-typescript and Storybook | green |\n| #128 | Curated mode gives a prop like recharts' `onTimeUpdate` the DOM attribute's type as well; ADR 0013, plus the note that `--load-dependencies` becomes the default in 0.5.0 | green |\n| #129 | Components built by a wrapper such as Mantine's `factory` get the extra props the wrapper's return type declares (`component`, `renderRoot`) | running |\n\n- **#84:** it failed because the oxfmt bump needed #102's formatting changes. I asked Dependabot to rebase once #102 was on `main`. Its next run lost a Node download inside proto, so I re-ran it, and it passed.\n- **Your main checkout:** `main` now matches `origin/main` and has no local changes.\n  - The 8 old local commits are on `backup/local-main-2026-09-28`; all 8 subjects are already on `origin/main` under new hashes.\n  - The 18 modified files (Entire hook configs and old version bumps) are in stash `main-checkout-cleanup-2026-10-23`.\n- **Rebase on latest `main`:** `main` hadn't moved since the stack merged. #127 and #128 were already on it, and I merged `main` into #126. I didn't rebase, because that would mean force-pushing.\n\nOn #129:\n- **Effect:** on Mantine core, the props we miss compared with react-docgen-typescript fell from 443 to 83, and 182 components gained props. The other four libraries are unchanged.\n- **Speed:** 64.2 → 64.9 ms, within run-to-run noise.\n- **Tests:** a test editing only the factory file in watch mode caught a bug in my first version, and it now passes. Of 774 Rust tests, 773 pass; the one failure is the macOS flake #126 fixes, which isn't on this branch yet.\n\n**Correction:** the 29% and 9% recall figures I gave you earlier were stale. On current `main`, component recall against react-docgen-typescript is 92–99% on all five libraries.\n\n**Still open on wrapper components:**\n- 60 Mantine props from `polymorphicFactory`, which declares its return type inside the function body as a conditional type; this needs the TypeScript backend.\n- 27 Chakra recipe variant props such as `size` and `variant`.\n- About 7 opaque factories (`createIconLoader`, `createIcon`).\n\nThe Chakra recipe props are the cheapest next step, if you want them.\n\nresult: All three tracks are delivered as PRs #126–#129: flaky-test fix, string-default quotes, curated-mode React attributes (ADR 0013), and Mantine wrapper props (missed props 443 → 83). #84 is green and the main checkout is reset to `origin/main` with backups kept."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_read_input_tokens":575651,"output_tokens":1105,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":565,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1105,"cache_read_input_tokens":575651,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":565},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"98e120b2-eff7-43b3-b29c-74987caa4a41","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgKnkU5GsRfTTfUPZ7zVK","requestRef":"cd122bee-442c-4470-b0a1-379dbae115e9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","a